{"type":"text","timestamp":1792286957187,"sessionID":"ses_eb36ab900ffesPzhYt7ZPkYvbn","part":{"id":"prt_14c9f7757001hJWRkQc3i47QnK","messageID":"msg_14c9f5ea10016CxyKRLfNqOz9a","sessionID":"ses_eb36ab900ffesPzhYt7ZPkYvbn","type":"text","text":"{\n  \"option_title\": \"Force-field error floor for coolant MD: an enlarged C10–C50 benchmark scored against measurement\",\n  \"question\": \"Does one GPU-MD force field rank C10–C50 hydrocarbons and esters in the same order as measured viscosity and thermal conductivity?\",\n  \"hypothesis\": \"One TraPPE-UA Green-Kubo protocol reproduces the measured ranking of coolants because its viscosity error is a systematic bias, not a random floor.\",\n  \"compute_axis\": {\n    \"quantity\": \"benchmark molecules scored (each one independent GPU-MD run)\",\n    \"unit\": \"molecules\",\n    \"levels\": [8, 30, 60]\n  },\n  \"held_fixed\": [\n    \"TraPPE-UA united-atom force field\",\n    \"temperature 313.15 K (raised for waxy C30+ where needed)\",\n    \"~10,000-site liquid box\",\n    \"2 fs timestep\",\n    \"20 ns per replicate, 5 replicates per molecule\",\n    \"NVT production ensemble\",\n    \"GROMACS GPU code\",\n    \"A100 40GB GPUs\",\n    \"measured values from DIPPR 801 / NIST TDE plus vendor datasheets\"\n  ],\n  \"predictions\": {\n    \"if_lever\": \"The MD-vs-measurement rank correlation reaches at least 0.9 once 30+ molecules are scored, so rankings can be trusted.\",\n    \"if_not\": \"The rank correlation plateaus below 0.75 even at 60 molecules, so the force-field error is a random floor.\",\n    \"decision_rule\": \"Spearman rank correlation rho(MD, measured) over all scored molecules: rho >= 0.90 for viscosity and for thermal conductivity -> if_lever; rho < 0.90 -> if_not; also require rho to stop changing as the set grows 8 -> 30 -> 60.\",\n    \"noise_rule\": \"Each molecule averages 5 independent seeds; a ranking change is real only if it exceeds the bootstrap 95% CI across seeds (Messerly double-exponential Green-Kubo fit).\",\n    \"expected\": \"unsure\",\n    \"expected_why\": \"TraPPE-UA viscosity deviations of 20-50% can scramble close rankings, but the bias may track chain length systematically, so ranking could still hold.\"\n  },\n  \"compute_tested\": \"yes\",\n  \"compute_tested_why\": \"Each added molecule is one independent GPU run, so more parallel GPUs/hours buy more molecules on the score axis.\",\n  \"scored_against\": \"Critically evaluated measured liquid viscosity and thermal conductivity from DIPPR 801 (LVS, LTC) and NIST ThermoData Engine, plus vendor datasheets (Castrol ON DC 15, Shell MIDEL 7131) for commercial coolants.\",\n  \"arms\": [\n    {\"id\": \"eta\", \"what\": \"shear viscosity from the same Green-Kubo trajectories, compared with measured liquid viscosity\"},\n    {\"id\": \"kappa\", \"what\": \"thermal conductivity from the same Green-Kubo trajectories, compared with measured liquid thermal conductivity\"}\n  ],\n  \"baseline\": {\n    \"what\": \"Green-Kubo MD scored against measurement exists only for a handful of molecules; Messerly et al. 2018 studied 14 normal and branched alkanes.\",\n    \"value\": 14,\n    \"source_id\": \"s1\"\n  },\n  \"anchor\": {\n    \"what\": \"Setup reproduces published n-hexadecane Green-Kubo thermal conductivity 0.14 W/(m·K) matching its experiment, before scoring other molecules.\",\n    \"published_value\": 0.14,\n    \"tolerance\": \"±30% (0.098-0.182 W/(m·K))\",\n    \"source_id\": \"s9\",\n    \"independent_code\": \"GROMACS gmx energy pressure-tensor/heat-flux autocorrelation, cross-checked by a standalone Python Green-Kubo integrator\"\n  },\n  \"checks\": [\n    \"Anchor: reproduce n-hexadecane thermal conductivity 0.14 W/(m·K) [s9] within ±30% before scoring any other molecule.\",\n    \"Per molecule: 5 independent 20-ns replicates; report bootstrap 95% CI via the double-exponential Green-Kubo fit [s1][s2].\",\n    \"Green-Kubo convergence: trajectory length >= ~10x the running-integral plateau time, block-averaged across seeds [s2].\",\n    \"Finite-size: confirm viscosity is unchanged between ~250 and ~1000 molecules before fixing the box.\",\n    \"Density gate: match measured liquid density within 2% at the scoring temperature before transport analysis.\",\n    \"Ranking: Spearman rho between MD and measured viscosity and thermal conductivity, with a bootstrap CI across seeds.\",\n    \"Cost guard: total GPU-hours x $1.99 <= $1,000; a timer stops the main allotment.\"\n  ],\n  \"phases\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p1\",\n      \"what\": \"Build GROMACS + TraPPE-UA setup; run 5 anchor molecules; reproduce n-hexadecane 0.14 W/(m·K); measure per-molecule throughput and error\",\n      \"stop_rule\": \"stop before the main spend if the anchor thermal conductivity falls below 0.10 W/(m·K)\",\n      \"gate\": {\"on\": \"anchor_kappa_md_w_mk\", \"op\": \">=\", \"value\": 0.10, \"else\": \"stop; switch force field (e.g. TAMie) and re-anchor before spending\"}\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p2\",\n      \"what\": \"Run the identical protocol over the enlarged C10-C50 hydrocarbon/ester set in batches (~30, then up to 60 total), scoring each against measured values\",\n      \"stop_rule\": \"stop when budget_usd is exhausted or 60 molecules are scored\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p3\",\n      \"what\": \"Fit the error distribution, split systematic bias from random floor, compute Spearman rank correlation MD vs measured for viscosity and thermal conductivity, write report\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"numbers\": [\n    {\"id\": \"n_anchor\", \"name\": \"anchor molecules in the pilot phase\", \"unit\": \"molecules\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 5},\n    {\"id\": \"n_main\", \"name\": \"additional benchmark molecules in the main phase\", \"unit\": \"molecules\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 55},\n    {\"id\": \"n_replicates\", \"name\": \"independent replicate trajectories per molecule\", \"unit\": \"trajectories\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 5},\n    {\"id\": \"replicate_ns\", \"name\": \"production length per replicate\", \"unit\": \"ns\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 20},\n    {\"id\": \"timestep_fs\", \"name\": \"MD timestep\", \"unit\": \"fs\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 2},\n    {\"id\": \"box_atoms\", \"name\": \"target system size\", \"unit\": \"sites\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 10000},\n    {\"id\": \"target_temp_k\", \"name\": \"scoring temperature\", \"unit\": \"K\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 313.15},\n    {\"id\": \"storage_gb_per_molecule\", \"name\": \"storage per molecule (Green-Kubo flux files)\", \"unit\": \"GiB\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 1},\n    {\"id\": \"months_kept\", \"name\": \"filesystem months kept\", \"unit\": \"month\", \"basis\": \"DESIGN\", \"value\": 1},\n    {\"id\": \"per_gpu_usd_h\", \"name\": \"A100 40GB price\", \"unit\": \"USD/GPU-hour\", \"basis\": \"CITED\", \"value\": 1.99, \"source_id\": \"s12\", \"quote\": \"NVIDIA A100 SXM | 40 GB VRAM/GPU | 124 vCPUs | 1800 GiB RAM | 5.8 TiB SSD | $1.99\", \"page_setting\": \"Lambda on-demand, 8xA100 SXM 40GB instance, read 2026-10-18\"},\n    {\"id\": \"throughput_ns_day\", \"name\": \"MD throughput per A100 GPU\", \"unit\": \"ns/day\", \"basis\": \"PROXY\", \"value\": 300, \"source_id\": \"s11\", \"quote\": \"A100 | 267,48 691,67 265,83 129,09 38,83 23,22\", \"page_setting\": \"GROMACS 2024 ns/day on A100 across six benchmark systems (267-692)\", \"differs_in\": [\"water/biomolecular GROMACS benchmarks, not 10k-site united-atom hydrocarbon boxes\", \"exact atom counts of the six systems not stated in the source\"]},\n    {\"id\": \"trappe_eta_dev_pct_max\", \"name\": \"max TraPPE-UA viscosity deviation, linear alkanes\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"basis\": \"CITED\", \"value\": 50, \"source_id\": \"s1\", \"quote\": \"TAMie) provide roughly 10 % accuracy for linear alkanes, while deviations are between 20 and 50 % for TraPPE-UA.\", \"page_setting\": \"Green-Kubo viscosity of normal and branched alkanes (Messerly 2018)\"},\n    {\"id\": \"messerly_alkanes\", \"name\": \"alkanes scored in prior work\", \"unit\": \"molecules\", \"basis\": \"CITED\", \"value\": 14, \"source_id\": \"s1\", \"quote\": \"Seven normal and seven branched alkanes of varying chain-length and degree of\", \"page_setting\": \"Green-Kubo viscosity study (Messerly 2018)\"},\n    {\"id\": \"dippr_chemicals\", \"name\": \"chemicals in DIPPR 801\", \"unit\": \"chemicals\", \"basis\": \"CITED\", \"value\": 1700, \"source_id\": \"s4\", \"quote\": \"The database currently contains the properties of over 1700 chemicals and is arguably the best process design database in the world.\", \"page_setting\": \"DIPPR Project 801 evaluated database (Wilding 1998)\"},\n    {\"id\": \"anchor_kappa_w_mk\", \"name\": \"n-hexadecane thermal conductivity anchor\", \"unit\": \"W/(m·K)\", \"basis\": \"CITED\", \"value\": 0.14, \"source_id\": \"s9\", \"quote\": \"thermal conductivity remains constant around 0.14 W m−1 K−1 in the studied temperature range.\", \"page_setting\": \"n-hexadecane Green-Kubo MD checked against experiment (arXiv 2203.07165)\"},\n    {\"id\": \"anchor_kappa_md_w_mk\", \"name\": \"MD thermal conductivity at the anchor molecule\", \"unit\": \"W/(m·K)\", \"basis\": \"GUESS\", \"value\": 0.14, \"rests_on\": \"TraPPE-UA alkane thermal conductivity is expected near the published n-hexadecane MD value 0.14 W/(m·K)\", \"measured_by\": \"p1\"},\n    {\"id\": \"sim_ns_per_molecule\", \"name\": \"production ns per molecule\", \"unit\": \"ns\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_replicates * replicate_ns\"},\n    {\"id\": \"n_steps_per_molecule\", \"name\": \"production steps per molecule\", \"unit\": \"steps\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"sim_ns_per_molecule * 1000000 / timestep_fs\"},\n    {\"id\": \"gpu_hours_per_molecule\", \"name\": \"GPU-hours per molecule\", \"unit\": \"GPU-hour\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"sim_ns_per_molecule / (throughput_ns_day / 24)\"},\n    {\"id\": \"usd_per_molecule\", \"name\": \"cost per molecule\", \"unit\": \"USD\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"gpu_hours_per_molecule * per_gpu_usd_h\"},\n    {\"id\": \"n_molecules_total\", \"name\": \"total molecules scored\", \"unit\": \"molecules\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_anchor + n_main\"},\n    {\"id\": \"gpu_hours_pilot\", \"name\": \"pilot GPU-hours\", \"unit\": \"GPU-hour\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_anchor * gpu_hours_per_molecule\"},\n    {\"id\": \"gpu_hours_main\", \"name\": \"main GPU-hours\", \"unit\": \"GPU-hour\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_main * gpu_hours_per_molecule\"},\n    {\"id\": \"usd_pilot\", \"name\": \"pilot cost\", \"unit\": \"USD\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"gpu_hours_pilot * per_gpu_usd_h\"},\n    {\"id\": \"usd_main\", \"name\": \"main cost\", \"unit\": \"USD\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"gpu_hours_main * per_gpu_usd_h\"},\n    {\"id\": \"storage_usd\", \"name\": \"filesystem cost\", \"unit\": \"USD\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_molecules_total * storage_gb_per_molecule * months_kept * fs_usd_gib_month\"},\n    {\"id\": \"total_stated\", \"name\": \"total stated spend\", \"unit\": \"USD\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"usd_pilot + usd_main + storage_usd\"},\n    {\"id\": \"budget_headroom_usd\", \"name\": \"unspent headroom\", \"unit\": \"USD\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"budget_usd - total_stated\"},\n    {\"id\": \"n_replicate_trajs\", \"name\": \"replicate trajectories bought\", \"unit\": \"trajectories\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_molecules_total * n_replicates\"},\n    {\"id\": \"total_sim_ns\", \"name\": \"total sampled ns\", \"unit\": \"ns\", \"basis\": \"DERIVED\", \"expr\": \"n_molecules_total * sim_ns_per_molecule\"}\n  ],\n  \"cost\": {\n    \"rates\": [\n      {\"id\": \"a100_40g_8x\", \"gpu\": \"NVIDIA A100 SXM\", \"gpu_memory_gb\": 40, \"n_gpus\": 8, \"per_gpu_usd_h\": 1.99}\n    ],\n    \"lines\": [\n      {\"id\": \"l1_pilot\", \"phase\": \"p1\", \"what\": \"Anchor 5 molecules; verify setup reproduces n-hexadecane and measure per-molecule throughput and error (40 GPU-hours = ~5 wall-clock hours on 8 GPUs)\", \"kind\": \"work\", \"rate\": \"a100_40g_8x\", \"hours\": \"gpu_hours_pilot\"},\n      {\"id\": \"l2_main\", \"phase\": \"p2\", \"what\": \"Time box: score the enlarged C10-C50 set up to 55 more molecules, ended by the budget timer (440 GPU-hours = ~55 wall-clock hours on 8 GPUs)\", \"kind\": \"allotment\", \"rate\": \"a100_40g_8x\", \"hours\": \"gpu_hours_main\", \"need\": \"gpu_hours_main\"},\n      {\"id\": \"l3_storage\", \"phase\": \"p3\", \"what\": \"Filesystem: Green-Kubo flux and coordinate files, ~1 GiB per molecule kept one month\", \"kind\": \"storage\", \"usd\": \"storage_usd\"}\n    ],\n    \"scenarios\": [\n      {\"id\": \"s_pessimistic\", \"what\": \"GPU throughput halves to 150 ns/day: only ~25 extra molecules fit the budget\", \"set\": {\"throughput_ns_day\": 150, \"n_main\": 25}},\n      {\"id\": \"s_optimistic\", \"what\": \"GPU throughput doubles to 600 ns/day: ~110 extra molecules fit the budget\", \"set\": {\"throughput_ns_day\": 600, \"n_main\": 110}}\n    ],\n    \"yields\": [\"n_molecules_total\", \"n_replicate_trajs\", \"total_sim_ns\"],\n    \"spend_cap_usd\": 1000,\n    \"total_stated\": 967.2\n  },\n  \"full_scale\": [\n    {\"id\": \"full200\", \"what\": \"The option's 'hundreds' target: 200 molecules at 100 ns each\", \"usd\": \"200 * usd_per_molecule + 200 * storage_gb_per_molecule * months_kept * fs_usd_gib_month\", \"ratio_to\": \"n_molecules_total\"}\n  ],\n  \"outside_budget\": [\n    {\"what\": \"researcher time to write the GROMACS protocol, run analysis, and write the report\", \"qty\": 20, \"unit\": \"hours\"},\n    {\"what\": \"DIPPR 801 database license for measured viscosity and thermal conductivity\", \"qty\": 1, \"unit\": \"license\"}\n  ],\n  \"restructuring\": {\n    \"sequential_part\": \"Each molecule's viscosity and thermal conductivity come from one Green-Kubo trajectory, ~50 million steps accumulated in order.\",\n    \"method\": \"None: every molecule is an independent run, so GPUs only run them side by side.\"\n  },\n  \"scope_gap\": [\n    \"Cannot test whether results generalize to fluorinated or silicone coolants, other force fields, or novel-candidate discovery; only C10-C50 hydrocarbon/ester ranking.\"\n  ],\n  \"novelty\": {\n    \"closest_prior\": \"Messerly 2018 scored Green-Kubo viscosity of 14 normal and branched alkanes against reference data; largest set used.\",\n    \"closest_source_id\": \"s1\",\n    \"prior_max_level\": 14,\n    \"left_open\": \"No prior work reports the force-field error distribution or rank correlation across dozens to hundreds of C10-C50 hydrocarbons and esters scored against measurement.\",\n    \"decides\": \"partly\",\n    \"searched\": true\n  },\n  \"limits\": [\n    \"Shows ranking reliability for one force field and one temperature; not best force field, not novel-coolant discovery, not fluorinated coolants.\"\n  ],\n  \"test_summary\": \"Run one GPU Green-Kubo protocol for viscosity and thermal conductivity over 60 C10-C50 hydrocarbons and esters, score against measured values, and test whether the MD ranking correlation holds as molecules are added.\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\"id\": \"s1\", \"url\": \"https://tsapps.nist.gov/publication/get_pdf.cfm?pub_id=926488\", \"quote\": \"TAMie) provide roughly 10 % accuracy for linear alkanes, while deviations are between 20 and 50 % for TraPPE-UA.\", \"supports\": \"force-field viscosity error magnitudes (error-floor prior) and the 14-alkane baseline set (Messerly 2018)\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s2\", \"url\": \"https://tsapps.nist.gov/publication/get_pdf.cfm?pub_id=925953\", \"quote\": \"To smooth noise in the Green-Kubo integral or Einstein slope, we recommend generating independent replicate trajectories (i.e., different initial configurations or random seeds to initialize velocities).\", \"supports\": \"5-replicate-per-molecule protocol and plateau-time simulation-length rule\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s3\", \"url\": \"https://www.aiche.org/dippr/events-products/801-database/thermophysical-properties\", \"quote\": \"Viscosity of Liquid | LVS | Pa∙s\", \"supports\": \"DIPPR 801 lists measured liquid viscosity (LVS) and thermal conductivity (LTC) as temperature-dependent properties\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s4\", \"url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0378381298003410\", \"quote\": \"The database currently contains the properties of over 1700 chemicals and is arguably the best process design database in the world.\", \"supports\": \"benchmark pool is large enough for hundreds of C10-C50 hydrocarbons and esters\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s5\", \"url\": \"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ir/2018/NIST.IR.8209.pdf\", \"quote\": \"Extensive use of the NIST ThermoDataEngine database (Diky et al., 2017) was made to locate data sources.\", \"supports\": \"NIST ThermoData Engine as a source of measured viscosity/thermal-conductivity data\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s6\", \"url\": \"https://www.castrol.com/content/dam/castrol/country-sites-new/en_gb/united-kingdom/home/documents/products/castrol-on-immersion-cooling-fluid-dc-15-product-data.pdf\", \"quote\": \"Castrol ON Immersion Cooling Fluid DC 15 is a synthetic hydrocarbon based dielectric coolant.\", \"supports\": \"a commercial single-phase coolant that is a hydrocarbon; datasheet gives measured viscosity 7.5 mm²/s and thermal conductivity 0.126 W/(m·K) at 40°C\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s7\", \"url\": \"https://www.shell.com/business-customers/lubricants-for-business/sector-expertise/power-industry/wind-power/windeurope-electric-city/_jcr_content/root/main/section/simple_2118681472/text.multi.stream/1726581237561/afecbe304426ba5866fc53afd2e9c01f31e63e0d/midel-7131-product-brochure.pdf\", \"quote\": \"MIDEL 7131 is a synthetic ester dielectric fluid designed to provide an alternative to mineral oil, silicone fluid and dry-type transformers.\", \"supports\": \"a commercial single-phase coolant that is a synthetic ester; viscosity 29 mm²/s at 40°C\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s8\", \"url\": \"https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/immersion-cooling-fluids-global-market-report\", \"quote\": \"The cooling fluid includes mineral oil, synthetic fluids, fluorocarbon-based fluids, and other cooling fluids.\", \"supports\": \"mineral oil and synthetic esters (C10-C50 hydrocarbons/esters) are the hydrocarbon/ester single-phase coolants the benchmark covers\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s9\", \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2203.07165\", \"quote\": \"thermal conductivity remains constant around 0.14 W m−1 K−1 in the studied temperature range.\", \"supports\": \"anchor value; the source also measured viscosity and thermal conductivity experimentally and compared to MD\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s10\", \"url\": \"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/Legacy/IR/nistir7170.pdf\", \"quote\": \"we note that a Green-Kubo simulation of duration 10^4 τ generates estimates with approximately 5% uncertainty in the shear viscosity and about 10% uncertainty in the thermal conductivity.\", \"supports\": \"expected GK statistical uncertainty, backing the noise_rule\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s11\", \"url\": \"https://hpc.fau.de/files/2024/07/2024-07-09_NHR@FAU_HPC-Cafe_Gromacs-Benchmarks.pdf\", \"quote\": \"A100 | 267,48 691,67 265,83 129,09 38,83 23,22\", \"supports\": \"throughput proxy: GROMACS 2024 runs ~267-692 ns/day on an A100 across six benchmark systems, so 300 ns/day is a conservative figure\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s12\", \"url\": \"https://lambda.ai/pricing\", \"quote\": \"NVIDIA A100 SXM | 40 GB VRAM/GPU | 124 vCPUs | 1800 GiB RAM | 5.8 TiB SSD | $1.99\", \"supports\": \"per-GPU price $1.99/hour for the 8xA100 SXM 40GB instance\"},\n    {\"id\": \"s13\", \"url\": \"https://manual.gromacs.org/current/user-guide/mdrun-performance.html\", \"quote\": \"around ~100 atoms/core or ~10000 atoms/GPU\", \"supports\": \"~10,000-site box size choice for one GPU\"}\n  ],\n  \"files_read\": [\n    \"/home/hal/dev/interp/latent_open/experiments/immersion-coolants/20261018-0100-loop/out/r1/card/work/seed-1/seed/idea/93fa9488/pilot/cost_calc.py\",\n    \"/home/hal/dev/interp/latent_open/experiments/immersion-coolants/20261018-0100-loop/out/r1/card/work/seed-1/seed/idea/93fa9488/pilot/cost_calc.out\",\n    \"/home/hal/dev/interp/latent_open/experiments/immersion-coolants/20261018-0100-loop/out/r1/card/work/seed-1/seed/idea/93fa9488/producer.md\"\n  ]\n}","time":{"start":1792286881623,"end":1792286957178}}}
